{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/60e2f6bdb97207ade09af745f764fe16.avif?t=1769076068\" width=722 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/2aba61bcb093a59b621c72afe2eb0ced.poster.avif?t=1769076068\" width=798 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/2aba61bcb093a59b621c72afe2eb0ced.webm?t=1769076068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/2aba61bcb093a59b621c72afe2eb0ced.mp4?t=1769076068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Each hand plays according to the standard rules of blackjack, but every hit, stand, or double down matters and creates a series of triggers that helps you beat the odds. Build your deck by adding new cards of different suits, all with their own perks:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spades cards will grant you additional damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hearts cards will recover health during battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clubs cards will increase your luck, helping your to get more favorables draws </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diamonds cards will steal chips from your opponent, allowing you to purchase new cards and trinkets<strong>\u00a0</strong>for the run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/b2901f8da85cfbdf9e57c24f8f741edc.avif?t=1769076068\" width=755 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/12b25501810fe58bdf0dc8f533e7f1b0.poster.avif?t=1769076068\" width=796 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/12b25501810fe58bdf0dc8f533e7f1b0.webm?t=1769076068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/12b25501810fe58bdf0dc8f533e7f1b0.mp4?t=1769076068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your journey with endless possibilities. Fine-tune your deck to suit your unique playstyle and craft synergies that defy the odds:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ Starting decks to unlock, each shaping your gameplay from the start.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your 2 starting suits, with the ability to purchase additional cards of any suits during your run to further customize your deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ trinkets to discover, acquired as battle rewards, during events, or purchased at the shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different card upgrade effects to empower your cards and gain a decisive edge during battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/2f69e315e7b4fd1cce6d554c6882b73b.avif?t=1769076068\" width=722 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/b68026af1e1de0b2c128cd6b4c86cad3.poster.avif?t=1769076068\" width=796 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/b68026af1e1de0b2c128cd6b4c86cad3.webm?t=1769076068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/b68026af1e1de0b2c128cd6b4c86cad3.mp4?t=1769076068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through a labyrinth of ever-changing casinos. Each map is procedurally generated, packed with secret events, dealers with rigged decks, and unpredictable challenges. No two runs are the same, ensuring endless replayability and strategic depth:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 difficulty levels, adding an extra layer of challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ unique events that will alter your run in different ways depending on your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different maps, featuring different pit-bosses at the end of each.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Opponent's decks and trinkets are randomly generated at the beggining of each run. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3446840/446ad9b0dde5b0eeb1f06301c2b009d8bbc7e8cd.jpg"},{"name":"Brawler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3446840/c38504e41ecce90d7a470982f476ed122668b7e5.jpg"},{"name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3446840/ef35dd5eb5919c2a18c80c94a7e2173d801d5e02.jpg"},{"name":"Crusher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3446840/af42ec6dd370a0a7271e99481c83a183e2cb19b5.jpg"},{"name":"Cursed odds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3446840/2bfbf93c6c719843d980a5fcc5cb4618de723fd9.jpg"